  happyP: {fileID: 0}
  sadP: {fileID: 0}
  anim: {fileID: 935304533407241411}
  greetingLines:
  - Wow. Click tab to continue.
  - Welcome to Whisker! This is a baking game where you can drop the different ingredients
    in bins to get a food!
  - The customers have their order recipe on their heads!
  - Move with WASD keys  or arrow keys and pick things up with E key!
  - Now the story begins!
  - "Nana(customer): HEY! you\u2019re Coco right? "
  - 'Coco(you): Yes??? But, who are you? '
  - 'Nana: Haha sorry, I forgot to introduce myself! '
  - "Nana: I\u2019m Nana. "
  - "Nana: You\u2019re new to the neighbourhood right? I love the way you\u2019ve
    set this bakery up! Let me be your first customer!!! "
  - "Nana: Hmmm\u2026 "
  - 'Nana: I''m feeling a baguette today, can you make that for me? '
  - "Coco: \u2026 "
  - 'Nana: What are you waiting for? Head to the kitchen! '
  - "Nana: By the way, whenever  you\u2019re unsure about how to make the pastry,
    just check the order combination on top of my head."
  thankYouLines:
  - "Nana: You sure have some great baking skills! I can\u2019t wait to see what
    you bring to the picnic! "
  - 'Coco: Huh? What picnic? '
  - 'Nana: Oops. '
  - 'Nana: I forgot to tell you! In a few days, we have a community picnic and everyone
    brings homemade goods. Don''t worry, I''ll remind you again when the day comes! '
  badLines:
  - "Nana: This doesn\u2019t taste quite right\u2026"
  - "But it\u2019s alright! Practice a bit more and you\u2019ll be ready for the
    picnic!  "
